{"text":"kuruntokai","n":177,"lines":["கடல்பா டவிந்து கானல் மயங்கித்","துறைநீர் இருங்கழி புல்லென் றன்றே","மன்றவம் பெண்ணை மடல்சேர் வாழ்க்கை","அன்றிலும் பையென நரலும் இன்றவர்","வருவர்கொல் வாழி தோழி நாந்தப்","புலப்பினும் பிரிவாங் கஞ்சித்","தணப்பருங் காமம் தண்டி யோரே"],"tr":["kaṭalpā ṭavintu kāṉal mayaṅkit","tuṟainīr iruṅkaḻi pulleṉ ṟaṉṟē","maṉṟavam peṇṇai maṭalcēr vāḻkkai","aṉṟilum paiyeṉa naralum iṉṟavar","varuvarkol vāḻi tōḻi nāntap","pulappiṉum pirivāṅ kañcit","taṇapparuṅ kāmam taṇṭi yōrē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"உலோச்சனார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Ulōccaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 26, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 14, veṇṭaḷai 12"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கடல்பா","tr":"kaṭalpā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடல்","tr":"kaṭal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"}]},{"text":"டவிந்து","tr":"ṭavintu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டவிந்","tr":"ṭavin"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"கானல்","tr":"kāṉal","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னல்","tr":"ṉal"}]},{"text":"மயங்கித்","tr":"mayaṅkit","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மயங்","tr":"mayaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கித்","tr":"kit"}]}],[{"text":"துறைநீர்","tr":"tuṟainīr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறை","tr":"tuṟai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீர்","tr":"nīr"}]},{"text":"இருங்கழி","tr":"iruṅkaḻi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இருங்","tr":"iruṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கழி","tr":"kaḻi"}]},{"text":"புல்லென்","tr":"pulleṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"புல்","tr":"pul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லென்","tr":"leṉ"}]},{"text":"றன்றே","tr":"ṟaṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றன்","tr":"ṟaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]}],[{"text":"மன்றவம்","tr":"maṉṟavam","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றவம்","tr":"ṟavam"}]},{"text":"பெண்ணை","tr":"peṇṇai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பெண்","tr":"peṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணை","tr":"ṇai"}]},{"text":"மடல்சேர்","tr":"maṭalcēr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மடல்","tr":"maṭal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சேர்","tr":"cēr"}]},{"text":"வாழ்க்கை","tr":"vāḻkkai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாழ்க்","tr":"vāḻk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]}],[{"text":"அன்றிலும்","tr":"aṉṟilum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அன்","tr":"aṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றிலும்","tr":"ṟilum"}]},{"text":"பையென","tr":"paiyeṉa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பை","tr":"pai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யென","tr":"yeṉa"}]},{"text":"நரலும்","tr":"naralum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நர","tr":"nara"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லும்","tr":"lum"}]},{"text":"இன்றவர்","tr":"iṉṟavar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றவர்","tr":"ṟavar"}]}],[{"text":"வருவர்கொல்","tr":"varuvarkol","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வரு","tr":"varu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வர்","tr":"var"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொல்","tr":"kol"}]},{"text":"வாழி","tr":"vāḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"நாந்தப்","tr":"nāntap","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாந்","tr":"nān"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தப்","tr":"tap"}]}],[{"text":"புலப்பினும்","tr":"pulappiṉum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புலப்","tr":"pulap"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பினும்","tr":"piṉum"}]},{"text":"பிரிவாங்","tr":"pirivāṅ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிரி","tr":"piri"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாங்","tr":"vāṅ"}]},{"text":"கஞ்சித்","tr":"kañcit","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கஞ்","tr":"kañ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சித்","tr":"cit"}]}],[{"text":"தணப்பருங்","tr":"taṇapparuṅ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தணப்","tr":"taṇap"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பருங்","tr":"paruṅ"}]},{"text":"காமம்","tr":"kāmam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மம்","tr":"mam"}]},{"text":"தண்டி","tr":"taṇṭi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டி","tr":"ṭi"}]},{"text":"யோரே","tr":"yōrē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோ","tr":"yō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கடல்","parts":[{"text":"கடல்","lemma":"கடல்","gloss":"ocean"}],"gloss":"ocean"},{"surface":"பாடு","parts":[{"text":"பாடு","lemma":"பாடு","gloss":"roar"}],"gloss":"roar"},{"surface":"அவிந்து","parts":[{"text":"அவிந்து","lemma":"அவி","gloss":"having subsided"}],"gloss":"having subsided"},{"surface":"கானல்","parts":[{"text":"கானல்","lemma":"கானல்","gloss":"seashore grove"}],"gloss":"seashore grove"},{"surface":"மயங்கி","parts":[{"text":"மயங்கி","lemma":"மயங்கு","gloss":"having grown dim"}],"gloss":"having grown dim"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துறைநீர்","parts":[{"text":"துறைநீர்","lemma":"துறைநீர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இருங்கழி","parts":[{"text":"இருங்கழி","lemma":"இருங்கழி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புல்லென்","parts":[{"text":"புல்லென்","lemma":"புல்லென்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றன்றே","parts":[{"text":"றன்றே","lemma":"றன்றே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"மன்றவம்","parts":[{"text":"மன்றவம்","lemma":"மன்றவம்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெண்ணை","parts":[{"text":"பெண்ணை","lemma":"பெண்ணை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மடல்சேர்","parts":[{"text":"மடல்சேர்","lemma":"மடல்சேர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வாழ்க்கை","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்க்கை","lemma":"வாழ்க்கை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"அன்றில்","parts":[{"text":"அன்றில்","lemma":"அன்றில்","gloss":"ibis bird"}],"gloss":"ibis bird"},{"surface":"உம்","parts":[{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"also"},{"surface":"பை","parts":[{"text":"பை","lemma":"பசுமை","gloss":"gently"}],"gloss":"gently"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என்","gloss":"as"}],"gloss":"as"},{"surface":"நரலும்","parts":[{"text":"நரலும்","lemma":"நரல்","gloss":"cries"}],"gloss":"cries"},{"surface":"இன்று","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"இன்று","gloss":"today"}],"gloss":"today"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வருவர்கொல்","parts":[{"text":"வருவர்கொல்","lemma":"வருவர்கொல்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாந்தப்","parts":[{"text":"நாந்தப்","lemma":"நாந்தப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"புலப்பினும்","parts":[{"text":"புலப்பினும்","lemma":"புலவி","gloss":"even if we feign anger"}],"gloss":"even if we feign anger"},{"surface":"பிரிவு","parts":[{"text":"பிரிவு","lemma":"பிரிவு","gloss":"separation"}],"gloss":"separation"},{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"then"}],"gloss":"then"},{"surface":"அஞ்சி","parts":[{"text":"அஞ்சி","lemma":"அஞ்சு","gloss":"fearing"}],"gloss":"fearing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தணப்பருங்","parts":[{"text":"தணப்பருங்","lemma":"தணப்பருங்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காமம்","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தண்டி","parts":[{"text":"தண்டி","lemma":"தண்டி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யோரே","parts":[{"text":"யோரே","lemma":"யோரே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"The ocean's roar having subsided, the seashore grove having grown dim, / the water of the shore and the dark backwater have indeed become desolate. / In the beautiful village common ground, dwelling in the palm fronds of the palmyra tree, / the ibis bird also cries gently. Today, will he / come? May you live long, friend! We, even if we fail / and feign anger, fearing separation then, / he is indeed the one who restrained this love that is difficult to separate from.","translation":"The ocean's roar has subsided. The seashore grove has grown dim. The waters of the shore and the dark backwater have become desolate. Dwelling in the fronds of the palmyra tree in the village common, the ibis bird also cries out gently. Will he come today, my friend? May you live long! Even if we, failing, feign anger, he is indeed the one who has restrained this love that is so hard to part from, fearing separation.","modern":"கடலின் ஒலி அடங்கி, கடற்கரைச் சோலை இருண்டு, துறையின் நீரும் கரிய கழியும் பொலிவிழந்துவிட்டன. ஊர் மன்றத்தில் உள்ள அழகிய பனைமரத்தின் மடல்களில் வாழும் அன்றில் பறவையும் மெல்லக் குரல் எழுப்புகிறது. தோழியே! நீ வாழ்க! இன்று அவர் வருவாரோ? நாம் ஊடல் கொண்டாலும், பிரிவுக்கு அஞ்சி, பிரிதற்கரிய காமத்தை அடக்கிக் கொண்டவர் அவரே அல்லவா?","explanation":"The friend is speaking to the heroine as evening falls and the hero has not yet returned. She describes the coastal landscape growing quiet and desolate to mirror the heroine's anxiety. The ocean's roar has subsided, the seashore grove has darkened, and the backwaters look lackluster. The ibis bird, famous for its devotion to its mate, cries out softly from the palmyra tree, intensifying the sense of loneliness. The friend comforts the heroine by reminding her of the hero's deep love and self-restraint, noting that even if they were to feign anger, he is the one who controls his intense desire out of fear of any real separation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}